From 19f3bbe5aaf528d1ee71536c872562f1e0830de4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:06:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] test-posix: Check setpriority across threads and
 groups, and children's getrusage

Make the priority changes in a child. Check that setpriority changes
every thread, clamps large values, sets every process in a group, and
that getpriority reports a group's lowest value and NZERO bounds it.
Check that RUSAGE_CHILDREN counts waited-for children and grandchildren
only, and not children discarded with SIGCHLD ignored.
---
